  "description": "Road Racing - Titanium\n\nThe Ti9 is a titanium racing frame designed for riders who ask a bicycle to perform at its highest level and reward them for the time spent in the saddle. Now updated to its T9.2 version, it sits at the performance end of the Stelbel range, slightly less aggressive than the SB/04 and sharing much of its temperament with the Antenore, with the added value of lower weight and the natural resilience to the elements that only titanium provides. The Ti9 has always had a clear ambition: to combine race-level performance with the kind of composure that turns a long day on the bike into something you want to repeat the following day. It is a frame built as much for competition as for the pure, lasting pleasure of riding.",
